<title>BELGIUM: Belgian tax receipts up four pct in year to August.</title>
<headline>Belgian tax receipts up four pct in year to August.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total Belgian fiscal receipts were up four percent in the first eight months of 1996 and up 2.7 percent in August from the same 1995 periods, the Finance Ministry said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
